    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dread: The Cold Case</strong> is a first-person  psychological horror where a bizarre murder investigation spirals into a desperate fight for survival. Forget the case \u2013 your only focus is staying alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master brutal, improvised melee combat. Rip pipes from walls, swing cinderblocks, or scavenge for anything you can turn into a weapon against the relentless horror hunting you. Parry attacks, strike from the shadows \u2013 whatever it takes to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore chilling, cinematic environments. Use tools like your UV light to solve environmental puzzles and uncover twisted clues. But remember, sometimes surviving the case is more important than solving it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
